OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'misjudged it' when driving
OL,4,Ainto crowd - trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder-accused man who drove a car
OL,7,Finto a crowd of people has said he
OL,8,F"just misjudged it" when trying to
OL,9,Fscare them.
OL,11,FDuane Anthony told a trial at
OL,12,FNottingham Crown Court on Tuesday he
OL,13,Fwas behind the wheel of a vehicle that
OL,14,Fhit five people in Gedling Road,
OL,15,FArnold, Nottinghamshire, on 9 May.
OL,17,FTyler Fairman, 26, later died from
OL,18,Finjuries he sustained in the crash.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
